{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_shardeddaemonprocess", "label": "ShardedDaemonProcess", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A thin wrapper over ClusterSharding: typeName 'daemon-<name>', entity id is the index string, rememberEntities true, LeastShardAllocationStrategy by default. The wrapper exists to remove boilerplate, send wake-ups so daemons materialise eagerly, re-send them on LeaderChanged/MemberRemoved, and provide the liveness safety net."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_handle", "label": "ShardedDaemonProcessHandle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "stop() halts the liveness heartbeat and cluster subscription but NOT the daemons themselves; messages to the raw region need {index, body} envelopes, so handle.tell is the intended path."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_liveness_heartbeat", "label": "Liveness heartbeat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A synthetic wake-up to every index every 30s. Deliberately belt-and-braces \u2014 sharding's own cluster-event subscriptions handle most failover; the ping only covers the edge case where an event was missed. Setting 0 disables it, useful in tests that drive cluster events deterministically."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_numdaemons_is_numshards", "label": "numDaemons becomes numShards", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixed at init and identical on every node, because the value becomes the sharded type's numShards and the coordinator refuses a diverging node. A rolling deploy that changes it leaves not-yet-updated nodes registered and updated ones refused until the last one is through."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_deterministic_per_index", "label": "Deterministic per-index behaviour", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The factory must produce the same behaviour for the same index, or a failover hands you a different daemon 3 than before."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_cardinality_tool_choice", "label": "Choosing the tool by cardinality", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1 -> ClusterSingleton (explicit election/lease semantics that N=1 daemon loses), fixed N -> ShardedDaemonProcess, one per business entity -> ClusterSharding, every node -> ClusterRouter. Large N is wrong here because every index starts eagerly \u2014 a thundering herd at init."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_options", "label": "ShardedDaemonProcessOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_shardeddaemonprocess", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_clustersharding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_shardeddaemonprocess", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_remember_entities_rememberentities", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_shardeddaemonprocess", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_handle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_liveness_heartbeat", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_shardeddaemonprocess", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_sharded_daemon_process_numdaemons_is_numshards", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_cluster_wide_agreement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/sharded-daemon-process.mdx", "source_location"